=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> of the future, <b class=\"lex-tr\">sure to come, certain</b>, <span class=\"gk\">αὐτίκα γάρ τοι ἔπειτα μεθ' Ἕκτορα πότμος ἑ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.96</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χώλωσις ἑτοίμη τοῖσι περιγινομένοισι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Art.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">66</span> </span>; also, <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy to be done, feasible</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπεὶ οὔ σφισιν ἥδε γ' ἑτοίμη</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">μῆτις</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.425</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἕ. [ἐστι] τὸ διαφθαρῆναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">imminent</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.706c</span> </span>: c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἕ. μᾶλλόν [ἐστι] ἀπεχθάνεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">567a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HF</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">86</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ γάρ τι ἕ. μεταπεῖσαι</span> it is not <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy</b>.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Paus.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.23.6</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> of the past, <b class=\"lex-tr\">carried into effect, realized</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ταῦτα ἑ. τετεύχαται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.53</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἠδ' ἄρ' ἑτοῖμα τέτυκτο</span